chore: architectural overhaul and ui redesign

This commit introduces major architectural refactoring (monorepo & dockerization) and a complete visual redesign leveraging modern CSS techniques.

Architectural Changes:
- Restructured project into a monorepo setup using NPM Workspaces.
- Moved frontend code to apps/web and renamed package to smart-timetable-web.
- Moved Node.js API to apps/api.
- Created root package.json for concurrent server execution.
- Added Dockerfiles for both web and api layers.
- Provided docker-compose.yml to spin up frontend, backend, and MySQL database locally.

Design & UI Enhancements (Visual Excellence overhaul):
- Updated typography to Google's 'Outfit' font family.
- Re-architected theme.css to use dynamic, glassmorphic CSS variables and neon accents.
- Modernized Login.css with a floating card, mesh gradient background, and glowing active inputs.
- Enhanced Dashboard.css with a blurred, glass-like navigation bar and distinctly colored, glowing user role badges.
